id: pm-gh1467
title: "GH-1467: Preserve optional extension value arity in machine contracts"
description: Investigate reported mismatch where optional extension labels are optional in help and dispatch but required in machine invocation contracts.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
