author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: Reproduce published and exact-source contract/help/dispatch parity; Carry optional arity through the canonical SDK declaration; Use the existing invocation parity verifier with real Commander observations; Cover optional/required/boolean/alias/repeated values without a second name registry
parent: pm-ugqx
risk: low
confidence: medium
resolution: "Publish explicit SDK value_arity and derive Commander, help, recovery and machine invocation contracts from one declaration; require complete installed/exact-tarball case inventories before publication"
expected_result: "Optional value consumption stays optional independently of required flag presence; CLI, SDK and machine contracts agree without a second optional-name registry"
actual_result: "Published2026.10.14 independently reproduces the optional-value contract mismatch. Both linked source runs and Node/Bun40-case extension acceptance pass; exact-candidate wiring refuses missing/failed cases and preserves reviewed controls during tag recovery. Typecheck, graph, integrity, mutation and SDK surface/import checks pass. Complete local static stops only at qualified startup budgets; final hosted static, whole coverage and revised review are required before merge. Package version14 is a baseline, not a claim that the candidate is published."
